        {
            "id": "concept:0001700",
            "type": [
                "skos:Concept"
            ],
            "seeAlso": [
                "tax_nodes:C0001700"
            ],
            "definition_en": "Steroidal alkaloids with a structure containing a spirostane skeleton. Spirostanes are 16b,22:22,26-diepoxycholestanes, or 22,26-epoxyfurostans. The sixth ring so formed is known as ring F. Chemically, the spiro centre at C-22 has the character of an internal acetal derived from a 16b, 26-dihydroxycholestan-22-one.",
            "note_en": [
                "Steroidal alkaloids with a structure containing a spirostane skeleton. Spirostanes are 16b,22:22,26-diepoxycholestanes, or 22,26-epoxyfurostans. The sixth ring so formed is known as ring F. Chemically, the spiro centre at C-22 has the character of an internal acetal derived from a 16b, 26-dihydroxycholestan-22-one."
            ],
            "prefLabel_en": [
                "Spirostanes and derivatives"
            ]
        },
        {
