            "definition_en": "This compound belongs to the class of organic compounds known as ethylene bisdithiocarbamates. These are dithiocarbamic acids (or derivatives) resulting from the formal addition of  a molecule of carbon disulfide to each amino group of ethylenediamine. In addition, compounds containing a 1,2-ethanediyl carbamodithioate moiety are also members of this class.",
